**STEP 1 — DELTA**
- [NEW] `betpandacasino.io/rest/settings`: real unauth Spring JSON (200) — full platform config incl. `strapiApiUrl:"/cms"`, Contentful space+token, freshchat/mati/amplitude/fingerprint public keys, per-currency withdraw limits, KYC flags, throttle settings. Also `x-site-name-id: betpandacasino_io` header (multi-tenant platform signal).
- [NEW] `betpandacasino.io/rest/maintenance`: real unauth JSON (serverTime + maintenanceWindow + productMaintenance) — same Spring backend, intended-public.
- [NEW] `betpandacasino.io/cms`: real Strapi v4 (Strapi error format + `market-assets.strapi.io` CSP). All probed routes 404 (`_health`, `api/auth/local`, `api/users-permissions/roles`, `api/casino-pages`, docs plugin) — zero unprotected surface, dead end.
- [NEW] `betpandacasino.io/rest/user/zendesk/jwt`: exists (405 GET, POST-only) — Zendesk SSO JWT gate.
- [NEW] `nano-public` Contentful token class verified: `cdn.contentful.com` 200 (0 entries) / `api.contentful.com` 401 → Delivery token, public-by-design → not a finding.
- [CHANGED] affiliates SPA unchanged (`main.ef021e68.js`); casino SPA `index-KqswHEbl.js` enumerated — minimal /user surface (authenticate, logout, account-balances-and-bonuses, zendesk/jwt).

**STEP 2 — PRIORITIZE**
- [PRIO] affiliates.betpanda.io/rest/*: 6.8 (b=9,a=9,g=3 auth-gated — CORS+creds+30 endpoints)
- [PRIO] betpandacasino.io/rest/user/*: 6.4 (b=9,t=8 Cognito JWT, g=2)
- [PRIO] betpandacasino.io/rest/settings+maintenance: 5.9 (g=10,f=10 but b=4 public-by-design; tenant-headers angle unproven)
- [PRIO] cable.betpanda.io: 5.7 (g=10 unauth ingestion)

**STEP 3 — HYPOTHESES**
[HYP] Wildcard CORS + credentials enables cross-origin exfil/ATO incl. password-reset + 2FA + deposit-limit tampering on affiliates API
class: MISCONFIG
asset: affiliates.betpanda.io/rest/*
confidence: 87
reasoning: OPTIONS preflight reflects any origin + ACAC:true (verified on /rest/user/password/reset). 30+ authed routes; /rest/user/metrics/affiliate GET-gated 401 — cleanest cross-origin exfil. ATO chain: change-password, set-2fa-setting, agent deposit-withdraw-limit. All gated on affiliate session cookie; SameSite flags unconfirmed.
evidence_needed: (1) Set-Cookie flags from affiliate login; (2) credentialed cross-origin GET returning data; (3) credentialed cross-origin POST returning success
verify_steps: AUTH_HELPED: login → GET https://affiliates.betpanda.io/rest/user/metrics/affiliate -H "Origin: https://evil.com" -b session → verify reflected ACAO + data; then POST /rest/user/set-2fa-setting with evil Origin
impact: Cross-tenant player PII/financial exfil, password reset, 2FA disable, deposit/withdraw-limit tampering → ATO. Critical (~9.1-9.3)
testability: AUTH_HELPED

[HYP] IDOR/BOLA on casino money-flow REST endpoints via Cognito JWT
class: IDOR
asset: betpandacasino.io/rest/user/*
confidence: 68
reasoning: Spring Boot + Cognito JWT confirmed; balances POST-only 405, settings 401, REFRESH_TOKEN cookie SameSite=Lax. No per-user ACL evidence beyond JWT sub claim. CORS pinned reduces cross-origin but same-origin IDOR viable.
evidence_needed: authenticated session + JWT sub/role manipulation → victim-identity balances/settings diff
verify_steps: AUTH_HELPED: capture JWT → mutate sub claim → POST /rest/user/account-balances-and-bonuses with victim-identity token → diff response
impact: Cross-user wallet/balance disclosure on real-money platform; High
testability: AUTH_HELPED

[HYP] Unauthenticated event ingestion enables stored-XSS/metrics poisoning on admin surfaces
class: BUSLOGIC
asset: cable.betpanda.io/cable/user-event
confidence: 65
reasoning: POST accepts arbitrary JSON, no auth, CORS *, 200 "processed and saved". XSS payloads in fields could render in admin/reporting UIs. No output-side verification possible without account.
evidence_needed: stored data rendering to other users / admin dashboard consumption
verify_steps: AUTH_HELPED: POST JSON with XSS payload in referrer/registeredOn → observe admin/reporting interface
impact: Stored XSS on admin panels / metrics poisoning; Medium
testability: AUTH_HELPED

**STEP 4 — SELF-CRITIQUE**
- [PARKED] Public `/rest/settings` exposure: client-consumed pre-auth by design; Contentful token is Delivery-class (cdn-only), widget/analytics keys public-equivalent. No non-public data observed. Not a finding.
- [PARKED] `x-site-name-id` tenant-confusion: header accepted on public endpoints but only tenant's own public config returned; no cross-tenant evidence. confidence 30.
- [PARKED] Strapi `/cms`: confirmed live but entirely 404 public surface.
- [FINAL] survivors ranked: affiliates MISCONFIG (87) > casino IDOR (68) > cable BUSLOGIC (65).

**STEP 5 — NEXT ACTION**
- [NEXT] HUMAN: Login to affiliates.betpanda.io, capture `Set-Cookie` (SameSite/HttpOnly flags) + session cookie, then run the credentialed cross-origin GET `/rest/user/metrics/affiliate` with `Origin: https://evil.com` — sole remaining blocker for the top finding; all three survivors are AUTH_HELPED.

**STEP 6 — LEARNING**
- [LEARN] ACCEPTED SURFACE @ betpandacasino.io/rest/settings + /rest/maintenance: real unauth Spring JSON; multi-tenant platform confirmed via x-site-name-id header + `operators/` S3 prefix. Intended-public client config — finding only if non-public tenant data ever leaks through these.
- [LEARN] REJECTED CRED @ Contentful d60p0ocvjh9m token `_cSq...a151zg`: Delivery-class (cdn 200 with 0 entries; management api 401) — public-by-design, not a finding.
- [LEARN] REJECTED MISCONFIG @ betpandacasino.io/cms: Strapi v4 confirmed (error format + CSP) but all public routes 404 — no unauth CMS surface.
- [LEARN] REJECTED XSS @ betpandacasino.io/rest/settings `customScripts`: admin-controlled script injection list is client-consumed public config, not attacker-controllable.
- [LEARN] ACCEPTED ENDPOINT @ betpandacasino.io/rest/user/zendesk/jwt: real POST-gated endpoint (405 GET) — Zendesk SSO JWT gate, auth unknown.

**STEP 7 — RISK**
- [RISK] BetPanda: 45 — Affiliates CORS+credentials (30+ endpoints, password-reset/2FA/financial tampering) remains the top channel; casino Spring/Cognito backend mapped (public config + auth-gated user surface now fully bounded). New cycle added real unauth config endpoints and confirmed CMS token/CDN/Strapi are by-design non-findings. All critical impact remains gated behind an authenticated affiliate/casino session.
